      "writtenOn": "2020-03-03T23:15:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "will this need to be updated for all of the child states?\n\nCould we make the entry drop this timer setting, and have the intial timer value as 0 (so it would tigger), then every time we perform the src caps we would through the timer into the future ( in the src_send_capcabilites state)",
